{
    "chapter_num": 11,
    "verses_count": 23,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Rehoboam’s Reign in Judah"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when Rehoboam came to Jerusalem, he assembled from the house of Judah and Benjamin one hundred and eighty thousand chosen "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who were warriors, to fight against Israel, that he might restore the kingdom to Rehoboam."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came to Shemaiah the man of God, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Speak to Rehoboam the son of Solomon, king of Judah, and to all Israel in Judah and Benjamin, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘Thus says the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ": “You shall not go up or fight against your brethren! Let every man return to his house, for this thing is from Me.” ’ ” Therefore they obeyed the words of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and turned back from attacking Jeroboam."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Rehoboam Fortifies the Cities"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Rehoboam dwelt in Jerusalem, and built cities for defense in Judah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he built Bethlehem, Etam, Tekoa, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beth Zur, Sochoh, Adullam, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Gath, Mareshah, Ziph, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Adoraim, Lachish, Azekah, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zorah, Aijalon, and Hebron, which are in Judah and Benjamin, fortified cities. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he fortified the strongholds, and put captains in them, and stores of food, oil, and wine. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also in every city "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "he put"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " shields and spears, and made them very strong, having Judah and Benjamin on his side."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Priests and Levites Move to Judah"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And from all their territories the priests and the Levites who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in all Israel took their stand with him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the Levites left their common-lands and their possessions and came to Judah and Jerusalem, for Jeroboam and his sons had rejected them from serving as priests to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he appointed for himself priests for the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Places for pagan worship"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "high places, for the demons, and the calf idols which he had made. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. after them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "after "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Levites "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "left,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " those from all the tribes of Israel, such as set their heart to seek the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of Israel, came to Jerusalem to sacrifice to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of their fathers. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they strengthened the kingdom of Judah, and made Rehoboam the son of Solomon strong for three years, because they walked in the way of David and Solomon for three years."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Family of Rehoboam"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Rehoboam took for himself as wife Mahalath the daughter of Jerimoth the son of David, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Abihail the daughter of Eliah the son of Jesse. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And she bore him children: Jeush, Shamariah, and Zaham. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After her he took Maachah the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. daughter, but in the broader sense of granddaughter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "granddaughter of Absalom; and she bore him Abijah, Attai, Ziza, and Shelomith. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Rehoboam loved Maachah the granddaughter of Absalom more than all his wives and his concubines; for he took eighteen wives and sixty concubines, and begot twenty-eight sons and sixty daughters. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Rehoboam appointed Abijah the son of Maachah as chief, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " leader among his brothers; for he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "intended"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to make him king. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He dealt wisely, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "distributed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "dispersed some of his sons throughout all the territories of Judah and Benjamin, to every fortified city; and he gave them provisions in abundance. He also sought many wives "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "for them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}